            "quote": {
              "text": "I'm planning a trip to Asia and I'm considering visiting Japan. Can you recommend some must-see attractions in Kyoto?"
            },
            "said_on": "2023-05-23",
            "sequence": 1,
            "source_id": "80856-1791154720822316000-40"
          },
          {
            "enrichment": "pending",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "I actually visited Fushimi Inari Shrine when I was in Japan a few months ago. I spent two weeks traveling solo around the country and it was an incredible experience. Can you recommend some good places to stay in Kyoto that are budget-friendly?"
            },
            "said_on": "2023-05-23",
            "sequence": 2,
            "source_id": "80856-1791154755040237000-66"
          },
          {
            "enrichment": "pending",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "I stayed in small hostels and guesthouses during my solo trip to Japan, and it was a great way to meet other travelers. Speaking of which, do you have any recommendations for good onsen (hot springs) in the Kyoto area? I visited one in the mountains during my trip and it was amazing."
            },
            "said_on": "2023-05-23",
            "sequence": 3,
            "source_id": "80856-1791154948145471000-120"
          },
          {
            "enrichment": "no_candidates_unreviewed",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "I'm actually considering visiting other parts of Asia after Japan. Do you have any recommendations for must-see destinations in Asia?"
            },
            "said_on": "2023-05-23",
            "sequence": 4,
            "source_id": "80856-1791155184015812000-196"
          },
          {
            "enrichment": "pending",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "I'm actually thinking of visiting South Korea. I've heard great things about Seoul and the food there. Do you have any recommendations for must-try dishes or restaurants in Seoul?"
            },
            "said_on": "2023-05-23",
            "sequence": 5,
            "source_id": "80856-1791155212234100000-202"
          },
          {
            "enrichment": "no_candidates_unreviewed",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "I'm thinking of visiting the Demilitarized Zone (DMZ) between North and South Korea. Do you have any recommendations for guided tours or attractions in the area?"
            },
            "said_on": "2023-05-23",
